---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms" description="Terms and general information governing use of RWA Wire.">
<section class="wire-container max-w-3xl py-16 sm:py-24">
  <p class="eyebrow text-wire">TERMS //</p>
  <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-5xl">Terms</h1>
  <div class="prose prose-invert mt-10 max-w-none">
    <p>RWA Wire publishes news, research and educational information about digital assets, tokenization and financial infrastructure. Content is provided for general informational purposes and does not constitute personalized investment, financial, legal or tax advice.</p>
    <p>While we aim for accuracy and may update or correct material, information can become outdated and we do not guarantee that every item is complete or error-free. Readers remain responsible for independently evaluating information before making financial decisions.</p>
    <p>Third-party names, trademarks and services belong to their respective owners. External links are provided for convenience and do not place third-party services under RWA Wire's control.</p>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
